{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/highcharts/01_install/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"highcharts-초기-설정-방법\" style=\"position:relative;\">Highcharts 초기 설정 방법<a href=\"#highcharts-%EC%B4%88%EA%B8%B0-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"highcharts 초기 설정 방법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>공식 문서 기준으로 설치/로딩 방법은 크게 5가지입니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-npm-권장--실무-표준\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. npm (권장 — 실무 표준)<a href=\"#1-npm-%EA%B6%8C%EC%9E%A5--%EC%8B%A4%EB%AC%B4-%ED%91%9C%EC%A4%80\" aria-label=\"1 npm 권장  실무 표준 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>React/Vue/Angular 등 모던 프레임워크 환경에서는 이 방식이 기본입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-bash line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> highcharts</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token comment\">// ES Module 방식</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Highcharts <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'highcharts'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 추가 모듈 필요 시</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Stock <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'highcharts/modules/stock'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Maps <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'highcharts/modules/map'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token function\">Stock</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token function\">Maps</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-cdn으로-로딩\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. CDN으로 로딩<a href=\"#2-cdn%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9\" aria-label=\"2 cdn으로 로딩 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>빠른 프로토타이핑이나 간단한 페이지에 적합합니다. 버전 관리가 필요하다면 버전을 명시하는 것을 권장합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">&lt;!-- 최신 버전 --></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>https://code.highcharts.com/highcharts.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">&lt;!-- 특정 버전 고정 (v12 최신 마이너) --></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>https://code.highcharts.com/12/highcharts.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-자체-서버에서-로딩\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 자체 서버에서 로딩<a href=\"#3-%EC%9E%90%EC%B2%B4-%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9\" aria-label=\"3 자체 서버에서 로딩 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>Highcharts 파일을 직접 다운로드해서 서버에 올린 뒤 사용합니다.<br>\n보안 정책상 외부 CDN을 허용하지 않는 폐쇄망 환경에서 주로 사용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/highcharts.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-es6-모듈-트리쉐이킹-가능\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. ES6 모듈 (트리쉐이킹 가능)<a href=\"#4-es6-%EB%AA%A8%EB%93%88-%ED%8A%B8%EB%A6%AC%EC%89%90%EC%9D%B4%ED%82%B9-%EA%B0%80%EB%8A%A5\" aria-label=\"4 es6 모듈 트리쉐이킹 가능 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>번들 사이즈를 줄이고 싶을 때 사용합니다. npm 패키지와 CDN 모두 지원합니다.<br>\n불필요한 모듈을 제외할 수 있어 대규모 프로젝트에서 성능 최적화에 유리합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Highcharts <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'highcharts/es-modules/masters/highcharts.src.js'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"5-amd--commonjs-requirejs-nodejs-환경\" style=\"position:relative;\">5. AMD / CommonJS (RequireJS, Node.js 환경)<a href=\"#5-amd--commonjs-requirejs-nodejs-%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD\" aria-label=\"5 amd  commonjs requirejs nodejs 환경 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>레거시 환경이나 서버사이드 렌더링(SSR) 대응 시 사용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token comment\">// CommonJS (Node.js)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> Highcharts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">require</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'highcharts'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"stock--maps--gantt-사용-시-주의사항\" style=\"position:relative;\">Stock / Maps / Gantt 사용 시 주의사항<a href=\"#stock--maps--gantt-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%8B%9C-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9D%98%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD\" aria-label=\"stock  maps  gantt 사용 시 주의사항 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">highstock.js</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">highmaps.js</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">highcharts-gantt.js</code>는 Highcharts Core를 내장하고 있기 때문에 <strong>highcharts.js와 절대 중복 로드하면 안 됩니다.</strong><br>\n여러 제품을 한 페이지에서 함께 써야 할 경우에는 아래처럼 모듈 방식으로 불러와야 합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token comment\">&lt;!-- Core 하나만 로드 후 필요한 모듈 추가 --></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/highcharts.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/modules/stock.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/modules/map.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/modules/gantt.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"your-first-chart\" style=\"position:relative;\">Your first chart<a href=\"#your-first-chart\" aria-label=\"your first chart permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>웹 페이지에 Highcharts를 포함시켰다면 이제 첫 번째 차트를 만들 준비가 된 것입니다.<br>\n간단한 바 차트(bar chart)를 만드는 것부터 시작해 보겠습니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-div-요소-추가하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. div 요소 추가하기<a href=\"#1-div-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"1 div 요소 추가하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>웹 페이지에 div를 추가합니다. id를 지정하고 차트의 너비와 높이가 될 특정 width와 height를 설정합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>div</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">id</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>container<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token special-attr\"><span class=\"token attr-name\">style</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span><span class=\"token value css language-css\"><span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>400px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-javascript-코드-추가하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. JavaScript 코드 추가하기<a href=\"#2-javascript-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"2 javascript 코드 추가하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>차트는 웹 페이지 어디에든 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;script>&lt;/script></code> 태그를 추가하여 초기화합니다. 1번에서 만든 div는 생성자에서 참조됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'DOMContentLoaded'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> chart <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">type</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'bar'</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">title</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">text</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Fruit Consumption'</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">xAxis</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">categories</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'Apples'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Bananas'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Oranges'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">yAxis</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">title</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">text</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Fruit eaten'</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Jane'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'John'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>Stock 차트를 삽입하는 경우에는 <code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.stockChart</code>라는 별도의 생성자 메서드를 사용합니다. Stock 차트에서는 일반적으로 데이터를 별도의 JavaScript 배열로 제공하며, 별도의 JavaScript 파일에서 가져오거나 서버에 XHR 요청을 통해 받아옵니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> chart<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 전역으로 사용 가능</span>\r\n\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'DOMContentLoaded'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  chart <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">stockChart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">rangeSelector</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">selected</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'USD to EUR'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> usdtoeur <span class=\"token comment\">// 미리 정의된 JavaScript 배열</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-결과-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 결과 확인<a href=\"#3-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"3 결과 확인 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>이제 웹 페이지에서 아래와 같은 차트를 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/78d47/image01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/a59e9/image01.webp 192w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/0ca9f/image01.webp 384w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/dc9b9/image01.webp 768w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/cf465/image01.webp 800w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/3b721/image01.png 192w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/66595/image01.png 384w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/fe486/image01.png 768w,\n/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/78d47/image01.png 800w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/62a26f6043bc011527603ff161471814/fe486/image01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"4-테마-적용하기-선택-사항\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. 테마 적용하기 (선택 사항)<a href=\"#4-%ED%85%8C%EB%A7%88-%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD\" aria-label=\"4 테마 적용하기 선택 사항 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>선택적으로 차트에 테마를 적용할 수 있습니다. 아래 두 가지 방법 중 하나를 사용하면 됩니다.</p>\n<h4 id=\"방법-1---사전-구성된-테마-로드하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">방법 1 - 사전 구성된 테마 로드하기<a href=\"#%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-1---%EC%82%AC%EC%A0%84-%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1%EB%90%9C-%ED%85%8C%EB%A7%88-%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"방법 1   사전 구성된 테마 로드하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>사전 구성된 테마는 <code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.setOptions</code> 메서드를 통해 전역으로 적용되는 옵션들의 모음입니다. 다운로드 패키지에는 여러 가지 테마가 포함되어 있습니다. 이 테마 중 하나를 적용하려면 highcharts.js 파일을 포함한 바로 다음에 아래 코드를 추가합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">type</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>text/javascript<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/js/themes/gray.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"방법-2---styled-mode를-사용하여-css로-스타일링하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">방법 2 - Styled Mode를 사용하여 CSS로 스타일링하기<a href=\"#%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-2---styled-mode%EB%A5%BC-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EC%97%AC-css%EB%A1%9C-%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80%EC%9D%BC%EB%A7%81%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"방법 2   styled mode를 사용하여 css로 스타일링하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><strong>Styled Mode</strong>를 사용하여 CSS로 차트를 스타일링하는 것도 가능합니다. Styled Mode가 활성화된 경우, 메인 Highcharts CSS 파일과 함께 추가 테마 CSS 파일 중 하나를 불러올 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@import</span> <span class=\"token url\"><span class=\"token function\">url</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string url\">\"/css/highcharts.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@import</span> <span class=\"token url\"><span class=\"token function\">url</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string url\">\"/css/themes/dark-unica.css\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>Highcharts의 옵션 또는 설정이 작동하는 방식에 대한 자세한 내용은 <a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/getting-started/how-to-set-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">How to set options</a> 문서를 참고하세요.\r\n아래는 이 문서에서 소개한 예시들의 온라인 데모 링크입니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/docs/simple-bar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple bar chart (간단한 바 차트)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/stock/demo/basic-line/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Highcharts Stock Example (Highcharts Stock 예시)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/getting-started/installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">installation | Highcharts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/getting-started/your-first-chart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Your first chart | Highcharts</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#highcharts-%EC%B4%88%EA%B8%B0-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\">